<title>SRI LANKA: Seylan Bank says '96 net down 29 pct.</title>
<headline>Seylan Bank says '96 net down 29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Seylan Bank Ltd for the 12 months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 4,412.17   vs	 3,386.55</p>
<p>     Net profit	 205.25   vs	   289.71</p>
<p>     Tax provision     48.01   vs	    90.91</p>
<p>NOTE - Seylan Bank Ltd is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
